{"id":"620995","name":"金色馒头","author":"付贵宝","authorId":"11281978","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/620995/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"馒头","amount":"一个"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/620995/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"馒头上蒸锅加热10分钟。","img":"images/620995/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"从蒸锅取出，切成片装盘备用。","img":"images/620995/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋打入盘中。","img":"images/620995/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"用打蛋器打成鸡蛋液。","img":"images/620995/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"馒头放蛋液中，两面均匀沾满蛋液，装盘备用。","img":"images/620995/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"起锅烧油，油烧热。","img":"images/620995/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"下馒头片煎制。","img":"images/620995/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"一面煎好翻面煎另一面。","img":"images/620995/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煎至两面金黄装盘。","img":"images/620995/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"雀巢炼奶备用。","img":"images/620995/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"小碟子放炼奶15克。","img":"images/620995/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"金色馒头片搭配炼奶。","img":"images/620995/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"馒头片蘸着炼奶吃。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}